# Line endings are stored as LF and checked out as LF, on every machine. A clone
# on Windows is then byte-identical to a clone on Linux, the test tools read the
# same bytes the browser does, and git stops rewriting files behind the editor's
# back. A per-machine core.autocrlf cannot promise any of that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.wav  binary
